/T (A significant portion of the customs duty changes is dedicated to healthcare, specifically aimed at reducing the financial burden of life-saving treatments. The government has fully exempted the Basic Customs Duty \(BCD\) on 17 cancer drugs, which is expected to drastically lower the cost of chemotherapy and related oncological care. Furthermore, the exemption has been extended to include seven rare disease medicines and specialized medical foods \(FSMP\) for personal use. )
/E (A significant portion of the customs duty changes is dedicated to healthcare, specifically aimed at reducing the financial burden of life-saving treatments. The government has fully exempted the Basic Customs Duty \(BCD\) on 17 cancer drugs, which is expected to drastically lower the cost of chemotherapy and related oncological care. Furthermore, the exemption has been extended to include seven rare disease medicines and specialized medical foods \(FSMP\) for personal use. )
