/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 123 0 R
/T (In a move to strengthen domestic aviation and defence capabilities, the budget provides BCD exemptions on components and parts required for the manufacture of civilian and training aircraft. A major highlight is the exemption of BCD on raw materials imported for the manufacture of aircraft parts used in Maintenance, Repair, and Overhaul \(MRO\) activities by defence units. This initiative aims to reduce the dependence on foreign MRO facilities, lower lifecycle costs for aircraft, and position India as a regional MRO hub for both civilian and defence aviation.)
/E (In a move to strengthen domestic aviation and defence capabilities, the budget provides BCD exemptions on components and parts required for the manufacture of civilian and training aircraft. A major highlight is the exemption of BCD on raw materials imported for the manufacture of aircraft parts used in Maintenance, Repair, and Overhaul \(MRO\) activities by defence units. This initiative aims to reduce the dependence on foreign MRO facilities, lower lifecycle costs for aircraft, and position India as a regional MRO hub for both civilian and defence aviation.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [12]
>>
