454 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 124 0 R
/T (To support the seafood industry, which has been hit by high tariffs in major markets like the US, the budget raises the limit for duty-free imports of specified inputs from 1% to 3% of the free-on-board \(FOB\) value of the previous year's export turnover. Furthermore, fish caught by Indian vessels in the Exclusive Economic Zone \(EEZ\) or on the high seas are now duty-free, even when landing at foreign ports, which is a major step toward supporting deep-sea fishing.)
/E (To support the seafood industry, which has been hit by high tariffs in major markets like the US, the budget raises the limit for duty-free imports of specified inputs from 1% to 3% of the free-on-board \(FOB\) value of the previous year's export turnover. Furthermore, fish caught by Indian vessels in the Exclusive Economic Zone \(EEZ\) or on the high seas are now duty-free, even when landing at foreign ports, which is a major step toward supporting deep-sea fishing.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
