<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 133 0 R
/T (Its strongest feature is the sustained push for capital expenditure. High allocations for highways, housing, and digital infrastructure anchor medium-term growth, while clean energy, especially rooftop solar and storage, emerges as a clear winner. Employment policy shows evolution, with a shift from open-ended welfare toward targeted, incentive-based job creation.)
/E (Its strongest feature is the sustained push for capital expenditure. High allocations for highways, housing, and digital infrastructure anchor medium-term growth, while clean energy, especially rooftop solar and storage, emerges as a clear winner. Employment policy shows evolution, with a shift from open-ended welfare toward targeted, incentive-based job creation.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
